@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Composants — socle observe et cible fonctionnelle
caption Depot c5d145b · cadrage §10 | Observe + cible clairement distingues
left to right direction
actor "Utilisateur / administrateur" as USER
component "Interface web\nReact / TypeScript / Vite" as UI <<present>>
package "Serveur Rust / Axum [present]" {
  component "Routeur HTTP\n/health, /health/db, /users" as API <<present>>
  component "Acces et comptes" as AUTH <<cible>>
  component "Catalogue / admin" as CAT <<cible>>
  component "Achats / ouvertures" as OPEN <<cible>>
  component "Portefeuille / paiements" as MONEY <<cible>>
  component "Inventaire / revente" as INV <<cible>>
  component "Statistiques / progression" as GAME <<cible>>
  component "SQLx / migrations" as SQLX <<present>>
}
database "PostgreSQL 17\nSchema initial disponible" as DB
component "SSO" as SSO <<externe>>
component "Paiement" as PAY <<externe>>
component "Emails" as MAIL <<externe>>
USER --> UI : interface responsive cible
UI ..> API : HTTPS / JSON [cible D6]
API ..> AUTH
API ..> CAT
API ..> OPEN
API ..> MONEY
API ..> INV
API ..> GAME
AUTH ..> SQLX
CAT ..> SQLX
OPEN ..> SQLX
MONEY ..> SQLX
INV ..> SQLX
GAME ..> SQLX
SQLX --> DB : acces PostgreSQL observe
AUTH ..> SSO : fournisseur D2
AUTH ..> MAIL : liens de recuperation
MONEY ..> PAY : paiement / notification
note bottom of API
  Observe : socle HTTP, connexion PostgreSQL et migrations.
  /users contient encore des reponses de demonstration.
  Orange : fonctionnalites cibles du cadrage, pas livrees.
end note
note bottom of DB
  Schema existant : users, cases, items, case_openings, etc.
  H1 exige de completer le modele achat / caisse acquise.
  Consentements, sessions et progression restent a concevoir.
end note
@enduml
